| Concern | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Dispatch** | `fflib_SObjectDomain.triggerHandler(Opportunities.class)` inspects `Trigger.new/old`, determines the event (e.g. `BEFORE_INSERT`), instantiates the domain via the inner `Constructor`, and calls the matching hook (`beforeInsert()`, `afterUpdate()`, …). |
